  "heading": "",
  "text": "fluidbox's promise is containment and accountability: hand an agent a repository and a credential, and still be able to answer, afterwards, exactly what it did and why it was allowed to. This page is the map of how that promise is enforced; the threat model and PLAN.md carry the full rationale."
